-- QuestLocFlavor (generado 2026-10-17): objetivos completos, con dialogos, solo para narrar.
_G.QuestLocFlavor = _G.QuestLocFlavor or {}
QuestLocFlavor[10] = {
[5000]={"Habla con Orthonn","Has recogido huesos de los montones de huesos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Pensándolo bien, ${PLAYER}, quisiera pedirte otro favor antes de que te vayas. Otro viajero pasó por este camino, un sujeto pequeño. Se dirigió hacia el oeste poco antes del ataque de los huargos a las tierras de cultivo.\
\
'Me preocupa que haya resultado herido... o algo peor. ¿Podrías buscarlo en Annúndir?'","Orthonn teme que un viajero que pasó junto a él haya sido atacado por los huargos durante el asalto a las tierras de cultivo.","Orthonn está en Ost Lagoros, en el borde oriental de Annúndir.\
\
Debes hablar con Orthonn.","Caídos ante los Huargos","'Veo que encontraste algunos huesos, ${PLAYER}. Algunos son bastante pequeños, pero no diría que pertenezcan al viajero que vi. A menos que me equivoque mucho, diría que la mayoría son huesos de trasgos.\
\
'Parece que huargos y trasgos no siempre se llevan bien, y eso es bueno para nosotros. ¡Que peleen entre ellos! Así tendremos menos de qué preocuparnos.'","Recoge huesos de los montones de huesos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una gran manada de huargos se ha asentado en el norte de Annúndir, y los huesos de sus víctimas cubren los túmulos funerarios del norte.\
\
Orthonn teme que un pequeño viajero no haya llegado sano y salvo a Amon Raith, y te ha pedido que busques en Haudh Eglain cualquier señal de problemas."},
[5001]={"'Gracias por encontrarme, pero me temo que no puedo volver contigo. Verás, cuando el capitán era perseguido por esos Angmarim mientras huía, algunos se quedaron y me persiguieron también. Pude escapar, pero...\
\
'...pero verás, ¡dejé caer su estandarte en mi huida! ¡Oh, soy un heraldo inútil! Los Angmarim se apoderaron de él y lo llevaron de vuelta a su campamento, en algún lugar de este lugar helado.\
\
'Ha estado en la familia del capitán durante generaciones: mi padre lo llevaba para el padre del capitán, y su padre antes que él, y así sucesivamente. No puedo presentarme ante él sin ese estandarte. ¡Por favor, ayúdame a recuperarlo!'","'Por favor, solo tienes que recuperar ese estandarte para mí. No puedo volver con el capitán Guarda habiéndolo perdido para siempre.'","Lleva el estandarte al heraldo de Reginald Guardián","Cuéntale a Reginald Guardián dónde se encuentra su heraldo extraviado","Se te ha pedido que encuentres al heraldo de Reginald Guardián, pero al encontrarle, te ha revelado que perdió el preciado estandarte familiar de su capitán.","El estandarte de Reginald Guardián se ha perdido en uno de los campamentos de los Angmarim de la cornisa de hielo, al sureste de Sûri-kylä.\
\
El heraldo de Reginald te ha pedido que recuperes el estandarte de su capitán, que perdió durante el ataque de los Angmarim.","Reginald Guardián se encuentra en Sûri-kylä, al noroeste de la cornisa de hielo.\
\
El heraldo de Reginald Guardián te ha pedido que le digas a su capitán que está a salvo y dónde puede encontrarle.","'Supongo que deberías decirle al capitán Guarda dónde estoy...'","'¿Lo has encontrado? Ah, eres un maravilla, ${PLAYER}. ¡Has salvado mi honor y el de mi familia!\
\
'Ahora que tengo el estandarte de vuelta finalmente puedo dirigirme a Sûri-kylä y reunirme con el capitán. ¡Qué alivio! No, nunca habría esperado que viniera a buscarme aquí. Nadie en esa comunidad tiene el más mínimo sentido de la orientación, ¡ni siquiera el cazador!\
\
'Así que, si fueras tan amable de darle instrucciones detalladas sobre dónde puede encontrarme, te lo agradecería mucho. Es un poco peligroso andar por ahí solo.'","Recupera el estandarte","Estandarte recuperado","Estandartes perdidos","'¡Un cordial saludo de nuevo, ${PLAYER}! ¿Tuviste suerte encontrando a mi heraldo extraviado?\
\
'¿Sí? ¡Espléndido! Es un chico valiente, ¿verdad? Sabía que estaría bien. Mi sincero y profundo agradecimiento por tu ayuda, camarada.\
\
'Supongo que lo mejor será que vaya a recogerle, ¿no? ¡Una vez que hayamos resuelto ese asunto, tendremos que encontrar al resto de la Comunidad!\
\
'¡Buena suerte, ${PLAYER}, si nuestros caminos se cruzaran de nuevo y necesitas mi ayuda, házmelo saber!'"},
[5002]={"Defeat enemies in the Fallows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fallows: Driving Back the Enemy","Has derrotado a un enemigo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hail, ${PLAYER}! Your valour drove back Núrzum, but the forces of Isengard do not seem to care that their leader has fallen. They continue to swarm our lands in great numbers.\
\
'The enemy is especially strong in the Fallows today. Go there, and show them that Wildermore will endure!'","Núrzum is dead, but the enemy still roams free throughout much of Wildermore.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","The forces of Isengard can be found in the Fallows.\
\
You should ride to the Fallows and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.","Regresa con Ealswith","'Well done! You have driven back the enemies of Wildermore for the day.'"},
[5003]={"'You have gathered the farming supplies left behind in the Fallows. The farmers of Forlaw will be grateful for this welcome delivery.'","Collect the sacks of supplies","Ealswith is in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Ealswith.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","'The farmers of the Fallows have felt a sore loss of their various tools and supplies. One is missing a hoe, another a sickle, and another some sacks full of goods.\
\
'Would you be willing to tour the farms in the southern Fallows to see what can be recovered? Many of the refugees of Wildermore have nothing. To reclaim the farmers' valuables would be a great kindness to them.'","The hoe, sickle, and sacks of supplies can be found at the farmsteads in the southern Fallows.\
\
You should ride to the Fallows and gather the requested supplies.","Collected the sacks of supplies","The farmers of the Fallows have oft requested the recovery of their valuable tools and supplies, left at the farms when all were abandoned.","Regresa con Ealswith","Collected the sickle","Collect the hoe","Fallows: The Farmers' Loss","Has recuperado la azada","Collect the sickle"},
[5004]={"Órdenes falsas","'¡Muy bien, ${PLAYER}! Espero que pronto cosechemos los beneficios de nuestra astucia. El próximo golpe debe ser rápido, porque está dirigido a un objetivo peligroso: Gillë Andras, el Señor de las Marcas occidentales.'","Drostan, ahora despojado de su nombre y llamado Soltakh entre los Trév Gállorg, está ansioso por redimirse.","'Haré honor al nombre de Soltakh a través de ti, ${PLAYER}, y las hazañas de Drostan caerán en el olvido.\
\
'Los cofres dentro de los cuales debes colocar las órdenes falsas se encuentran en la ciudad de Dûn Covad, en las colinas occidentales al norte de Fail-á-Khro. Lleva un aliado o dos contigo, porque la ciudad está muy defendida.'","Se pueden encontrar cofres por toda la ciudad de Dûn Covad, en las colinas occidentales al norte de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Soltakh te ha pedido que deslices órdenes falsas en los cofres utilizados por la cadena de mando angmarim para la comunicación de tareas.","Plantar órdenes falsas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Órdenes falsas plantadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Soltakh se encuentra en Fail-á-Khro, al sur de Dûn Covad y al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Después de deslizar las órdenes falsas en los cofres de los Angmarim, deberías regresar a Soltakh en Fail-á-Khro.","Habla con Soltakh","'Has luchado bien y con valentía en Clúcath, ${PLAYER}, y aprecio la misericordia que me has mostrado; Domongart y Avair no lo entendieron, y quizás nunca lo hagan. Ya no soy Drostan; ahora soy Soltakh, \\qEl Que Cambió,\\q y Soltakh busca redimirse.\
\
'Puedo ayudar a los Trév Gállorg con lo que sé, valiente ${RACE}: sé cómo los Orcos reciben sus órdenes, y podemos usar este conocimiento a nuestro favor. Lleva un aliado o dos contigo en esta excursión, y nuestro éxito será seguro.\
\
'La ciudad de Dûn Covád, en las colinas occidentales al norte de Fail-á-Khro, está llena de Orcos; estos Orcos guardan sus órdenes en cajas fuertes ubicadas por toda la ciudad. Toma estas páginas que tengo en mi poder; fueron preparadas por Domongart, pero he reemplazado varios puntos clave: sembrarán disensión y descontento entre los Orcos si las colocas en las cajas fuertes de Dûn Covád.'"},
[5005]={"Coloca falsas protecciones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Gracias por tu ayuda con los Gauredain. Gracias a tus esfuerzos, creo que pasará algún tiempo antes de que nos molesten de nuevo.'","'Esta última tarea debería ser relativamente simple. Solo tienes que modificar los marcadores gauradan a lo largo del río tal como te mostré. \
\
'Una vez hecho esto, los Gauredain evitarán el río y las tierras al sur de él... al menos por un tiempo.'","Erchiel está lista para avanzar con las etapas finales del plan que Lithuifin la ayudó a elaborar.","'Ah, bien hecho, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amigA[f]}. Eso debería reducir en gran medida la amenaza de los Gauredain por ahora.\
\
'Esa línea de protecciones no impedirá su cruce para siempre, ni detendrá a sus cazadores más tercos o valientes, pero me ocuparé de ellos cuando sea necesario. Lo que sí hará es evitar que estalle una guerra abierta entre su tribu y quienes vivimos aquí en las Agujas de la Linde, y eso es suficiente por el momento.\
\
'Tienes mi más profundo agradecimiento, y aunque no tengo más tareas para ti, puede que quieras hablar con Lithuifin o Ramalarga por si alguno necesita tu ayuda.'","Erchiel te ha pedido modificar una serie de marcadores gauradan para convertirlos en Protecciones de Perdición y evitar que los Gauredain crucen hacia las Agujas de la Linde.\
\
Los marcadores se encuentran a lo largo del río, al norte de las Agujas de la Linde.","'Esta tarea final debería ser bastante sencilla. Los marcadores que buscas están en la orilla norte del río que pasa junto a las Agujas de la Linde.'","Debes regresar y contarle a Erchiel que has terminado de colocar las protecciones.\
\
Erchiel está en las Agujas de la Linde, al sur del río.","Habla con Erchiel","Falsas protecciones","'He oído rumores de poderes oscuros que vuelven a agitarse en tierras distantes, y del paso de ejércitos que se reúnen al compás de un ritmo antiguo que conozco demasiado bien.'","'Buena suerte a ti, para quien este mundo quizá esté destinado. Mi esposo y yo permaneceremos aquí y veremos cómo se desarrolla este drama, y con el tiempo partiremos también hacia el Oeste. Aun así, espero que seas victorioso, pues sigo sintiendo afecto por estas tierras y no deseo verlas entregadas a la mano del Enemigo de antaño.'","'Como guerrera de cierto renombre, estoy muy acostumbrada a combatir, y siempre lidio con —y hago uso de— la amenaza de muerte. Contra enemigos tan vulgares como trasgos y orcos, esa amenaza suele bastar para quebrar su ánimo y hacerlos huir de regreso a la oscuridad, salvo cuando son impulsados por amos poderosos... pero no es así con los Gauredain.\
\
'Como Lithuifin me recordó, Hombres como ellos, aún libres de espíritu y orgullo, suelen conceder más valor a los mundos invisibles e intangibles que a sus propias vidas. Las protecciones fueron la pista, y en ello nos apoyaremos para mantener separados nuestros respectivos campamentos. Quizá hayas notado varios marcadores gauradan a lo largo de la orilla del río justo al norte de aquí. Esos marcan los límites actuales del territorio de los Gauredain —al menos como ellos lo perciben. Pero en absoluto les impiden cruzar hacia nuestro lado del bosque. Eso vamos a cambiarlo ahora.\
\
'He modificado las protecciones que me trajiste y añadido algunos detalles. Si las colocas junto a los marcadores de frontera, dejarán de ser simples límites territoriales y se convertirán en Protecciones de Perdición para los Gauredain: una advertencia de que cualquiera que cruce pondrá su espíritu en serio peligro. Los Gauredain pueden no respetar nuestras espadas ni arcos, pero esto no lo ignorarán tan fácilmente.'","'Aunque mi corazón arde con la idea de poder vengar agravios antiguos, por el bien de Lithuifin no me uniré a esta canción de batalla. No esta vez.'","Falsas protecciones colocadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[5006]={"'Arbustorojo estará ansioso por ver lo que hemos hecho, ¡y yo estoy ansioso por pagarte! Búscalo en la tienda de armas y armaduras al este del Ayuntamiento de Bree.'","'Estas reliquias apenas valen el pago de un mensajero. Falster debe pensar que soy un tonto si cree que le pagaré su tarifa completa por un puñado de copas y jarras inútiles. ¡Intentar que acepte su mediocridad añadiendo unos dientes de lobo es una locura!\
\
'Toma esto. Verá que es mucho menos de lo que esperaba, pero es lo que merece por una colección tan pobre.\
\
'Ve rápido, ${RACE}. ¡Quiero que ese embaucador sepa que Ollie Arbustorojo no es ningún ingenuo!'","'Encontraré la forma de seguir adelante, con o sin Ollie Arbustorojo.'","Entrega de Falster","'¿Buscas más limosnas? No tengo nada más que ofrecer a un mensajero que me entrega reliquias inútiles y dientes de lobo. Lleva la bolsa de monedas a Falster con mi decepción... y no me molestes más.'","'¿No te dio Arbustorojo el pago por los bienes que le llevamos?'","'¡No puedo creer que Arbustorojo me haya pagado tan mal!'","Entrega el saco de objetos a Ollie Arbustorojo.","Ollie Arbustorojo está esperando en la tienda de armas y armaduras al este del Ayuntamiento de Bree.\
\
Falster colocó las reliquias que reuniste en un saco y te pidió que lo entregaras a Ollie Arbustorojo.","'¡Ollie Arbustorojo no es ningún ingenuo, te lo aseguro!'","Entrega la bolsa de monedas a Falster el Zorro.","'Gracias nuevamente por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}.'","'¡Has hecho un trabajo excelente al conseguir estas reliquias, así que me parece justo que también te encargues de entregarlas!\
\
'Mi empleador espera la entrega de estas reliquias — su nombre es Ollie Arbustorojo, y lo encontrarás en la tienda de armas y armaduras al este del Ayuntamiento de Bree. He colocado todas las reliquias en un saco para que sea más fácil transportarlas.\
\
'Si haces esta entrega, estoy seguro de que Ollie te dará mi pago y te enviará de vuelta conmigo. Cuando regreses, te daré el salario justo de un mensajero.'","'He terminado de tratar con Falster. ¡Es un villano!'","Falster el Zorro está en La Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias, al este de Bree.\
\
Ollie Arbustorojo te dio un pago escaso y expresó su descontento antes de enviarte de regreso con Falster el Zorro en La Posada Abandonada.","Falster quedó satisfecho con tu ayuda y ahora quiere que los objetos que reuniste sean entregados a Ollie Arbustorojo.","'¡Desagradecido! Arbustorojo tiene el descaro de intentar presionarme. Hiciste la entrega, pero su mensaje para mí es que no fue suficiente. ¿No se da cuenta de que las fortunas del comercio cambian?\
\
'No te abandonaré como él lo ha hecho conmigo. Aquí tienes tu pago. Ojalá pudiera darte más, pero él me ha puesto en una situación difícil.'","'No tengo asuntos que tratar contigo, y no haces más que estorbar cerca de mi hogar. Haz algo útil o desaparece. Tú decides.'"},
[5007]={"Las monedas y reliquias pueden encontrarse entre los escombros de Arnor en el valle bajo Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada. También hay lobos merodeando por el valle.\
\
Falster el Zorro, un comerciante que trabaja para un hombre llamado Ollie Arbustorojo, te ha pedido que recojas algunas monedas antiguas y reliquias para él. Falster quiere que caces lobos en la zona para obtener dientes que puedan compensar el retraso en su entrega a Ollie Arbustorojo.","Reliquias de Arnor reunidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Gracias por tu ayuda. Hoy en día, necesito toda la asistencia que pueda conseguir.'","Entrega las curiosidades a Falster el Zorro.","Reúne Dientes de lobo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me gano la vida comerciando con los clientes de la Posada Abandonada... o mejor dicho, solía hacerlo, ¡hasta que llegaron los trasgos! Su presencia ha asustado a mis proveedores y ha hecho imposible el comercio. Lamentablemente, eso no elimina mi obligación con Ollie Arbustorojo, mi empleador en Bree.\
\
'Un valle bajo las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de la Posada Abandonada, contiene las monedas y reliquias que necesito, ¡y más! Lobos habitan el valle, y Ollie podría perdonarme el retraso si incluyo algunos dientes de lobo intactos en el envío.\
\
'Si me ayudas a reunir estas curiosidades, ¡me aseguraré de que recibas un pago por el favor! Dirígete al valle bajo Minas Eriol y consigue monedas, reliquias y dientes de lobo para mí.'","Monedas de Arnor reunidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encargo de Falster","Dientes de lobo reunidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ya he tenido suficiente de trasgos. Alguien debería hacer algo.'","Reúne Reliquias de Arnor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Dirígete al valle bajo las ruinas de Minas Eriol, al sureste de aquí. Necesito algunas monedas y reliquias para enviar a Ollie Arbustorojo. Unos dientes de lobo tampoco vendrían mal.'","'Ollie estará complacido con estas curiosidades, sin duda, y los dientes de lobo deberían ayudar a mejorar el trato.\
\
'Debo admitir que no estaba seguro de que lo lograrías. La llegada de los trasgos ha cambiado mucho la naturaleza de mi trabajo aquí en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
'Te has ganado esta recompensa, y espero que te parezca suficiente. Sé que Arbustorojo estará satisfecho con esta entrega.'","Reúne Monedas de Arnor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Falster el Zorro, un residente de la Posada Abandonada, necesita ayuda para adquirir ciertas curiosidades para Ollie Arbustorojo, de Bree."},
[5008]={"People can be found inside Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have arrived at Glaniath, but have not yet seen Faltharan. You should ask an inhabitant of Glaniath if they have seen him.","Ask someone in Glaniath if Faltharan has arrived","Faltharan readies himself for the journey into Upper Lebennin where he hopes to uncover his father's fate.","Travel to Glaniath in Upper Lebennin","Faltharan's Charge","You have arrived at Glaniath, but Faltharan is nowhere to be found","The gate into Upper Lebennin can be found in north-eastern Pelargir.\
\
Faltharan has asked you to travel into Upper Lebennin and aid him in seeking his lost father. You should travel to the eastern gate.","Glaniath can be found along the road outside the eastern gate of Pelargir.\
\
Faltharan has bidden you to meet him at Glaniath, a small farming village in Upper Lebennin. He hopes to begin his search in the surrounding area.","'Are you prepared, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'If my father yet lives, I know he must be in Upper Lebennin. The Haradrim would not trouble themselves to ferry a prisoner so far unless he was of great import to the Enemy.\
\
'I know of a small village to the north-east that is home to good folk. I suggest that we meet there, and begin our search in the surrounding lands.\
\
'Travel through the eastern gate and follow the road... I shall meet you there as soon as I am able!'","'I have not seen the man you describe, traveller.\
\
'I assure you, were the lord regent to visit our village, his presence would be known to us all.\
\
'You are welcome to await his arrival here... and perhaps you might be of aid to me in the meantime.'","The road into Upper Lebennin lies ahead...","Travel to the eastern gate of Pelargir"},
[5009]={"Faltharan can be found at the steps to Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","'I know why you're here, but this matter is too important to leave to anyone else.\
\
'I understand Thandor's concern, but I need to be the one to deal with this, otherwise the bloodline of Sirgon will be forever tainted with whispers of treason.\
\
'You have been one of my greatest allies in these dark days, and I would be honoured to have you by my side when I face Lorvegil.'","Talk to Faltharan","'And with that final bout of treachery, we see the legacy of Sirgon for what it truly is. A traitorous son, and another who was completely unaware.\
\
'He will face punishment for what he has done, but with war at our doorstep, I cannot be making time for personal justice right now. That day will come when the skies are once again bright.\
\
'I thank you for everything, ${PLAYER}.'","'Come, let us make our way into the east-garth, and prepare for the challenge that lies ahead.'","DNT - Not Used","Speak with Faltharan","Faltharan's Confrontation","Join Faltharan as he confronts Lorvegil","Spoke with Faltharan","You have discovered the location of the traitor Lorvegil, and must help Faltharan bring him to justice.","'${PLAYER}, you must help me convince Faltharan of his mistake!\
\
'He intends to confront his brother by himself, without anyone's help. I tried to convince him to take some of my men with him, but he's grown distrustful of me after not telling him about our investigation. I only wanted to protect the Lord-Regent....\
\
'Could you speak with him? If I have fallen from his graces, then perhaps you can convince him not to do this alone.'"},
[5010]={"'Tienes mi agradecimiento, ${PLAYER}.'","Regresa a Declan con noticias de su abuelo","Un bardo, Declan te ha pedido que investigues los Salones de la Noche y regreses con cualquier pista sobre la desaparición de su abuelo.","Descubre lo que le sucedió a Durell","'¿Durell? Sí... ese fue mi nombre una vez, aunque me temo que no puedo recordar cuánto tiempo ha pasado desde la última vez que lo escuché...\
\
'Descubrimos la tumba por accidente. Una terrible tormenta nos obligó a refugiarnos en lo que pensamos que era una caverna poco profunda. Cuando pasó la tormenta, descubrimos la entrada del túmulo. Envié a mi aprendiz de regreso con una carta anotando nuestros hallazgos.\
\
'Es un consuelo saber que mi familia nunca me ha olvidado.'","'¡Hola! Eres ${PLAYER}, ¿verdad? Los montañeses hablaron de ti, por eso sé quién eres. Te reconocí por tu equipo, no es el de los sombríos hombres del norte, desde luego.\
\
'Mi nombre es Declan. Soy un Bardo de oficio, aunque me atrevo a decir que a mi familia no le gustaría que fuera así. Llegué a Aughaire por casualidad, o destino, o quizás por pura suerte aleatoria. No me gusta pensar en los largos caminos que me llevaron a buscar la historia de mi familia.\
\
'Mi abuelo era un famoso explorador, Durell... ¿quizás hayas oído hablar de él? Lanzó una expedición en busca de antiguas reliquias del norte. Aunque recibimos una carta críptica sobre algunos de sus hallazgos, Durell nunca regresó.\
\
'Así que aquí estoy, pluma en mano. Mientras estaba seguro en casa, soñaba con descubrir los secretos de mi abuelo y escribirlos en un cuento adecuado, pero me temo que, habiendo mirado yo mismo estas colinas, no tengo la voluntad de buscar el túmulo del que habla su carta. Habla de algo llamado los Salones de la Noche... ¿lo buscarás por mí?'","'Lo que describes es... difícil de asimilar.\
\
'Cuando era niño, siempre esperé que un día mi abuelo regresara con un carro lleno de oro y joyas estacionado en el establo. A medida que crecía, me llenaban otros sentimientos; ira, tristeza, arrepentimiento.\
\
'Escuchar que has hablado con él... Yo... No estoy seguro de cómo me siento ahora. Te doy las gracias más sinceras por todo lo que has hecho.'","Los Salones de la Noche se encuentran entre las colinas al este de Aughaire, más allá de la puerta norte.\
\
Descubre lo que le sucedió a Durell en los Salones de la Noche.","'Debe estar dentro de los Salones de la Noche. Estoy seguro de ello.'","Has descubierto que Sombra es el abuelo de Declan, su espíritu atrapado durante siglos en los Salones de la Noche.","'Dile a mi familia que he encontrado la paz.'","Historia Familiar"},
[5011]={"Found the site of Alferth's death","The memorial dedicated to Gárwig's grandson Wilsig can be found in the southern Writhendowns.\
\
You should light the memorial flame for Wilsig to ease the grief of his grandfather.","The memorial dedicated to Gárwig's grandson Cuthard can be found in the southern Writhendowns.\
\
You should light the memorial flame for Cuthard to ease the grief of his grandfather.","Lit the memorial flame for Wilsig","Assure Gárwig that his grandsons have been honoured","Find the memorial dedicated to Wilsig","'So much death! My family drowns in it, ${PLAYER}. I would give anything to see my fallen sons and grandsons alive once more.\
\
'When the snows first started, three of my grandsons rode out into the Writhendowns and were killed by an unknown creature. The rumours of their killer did not live up to the creature's true form: the giant that murdered the men in Scylfig.\
\
'This was many weeks ago, and now there are memorial flames marking the places where their bodies were found. Will you light the flames for me? I am too old, too broken-hearted, to ride out.'","Gárwig is in the Mead Hall Lornsettle in Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Gárwig, and offer him the comfort that the flames burn bright in memory of his fallen grandsons.","Lit the memorial flame for Cuthard","Light the memorial flame for Gárwig's grandson, Cuthard","Gárwig has lost many sons and grandsons of late, both at Scylfig and earlier, when the snows first started to fall. He would like you to tend to the memorials placed at the sites where his grandsons fell.","Found the site of Cuthard's death","Found the site of Wilsig's death","'I thank you for your kind gesture, ${PLAYER}. Nothing will ever replace those brave boys...men, I suppose they were, but they must be given their due honour in death.\
\
'Poor boys, poor boys. I remember when they played at my feet....'","Historia Familiar","The memorial dedicated to Gárwig's grandson Alferth can be found in the southern Writhendowns.\
\
You should light the memorial flame for Alferth to ease the grief of his grandfather.","Light the memorial flame for Gárwig's fallen grandson, Alferth","Light the memorial flame for Gárwig's grandson, Wilsig","'Cyneberg told us that you defended Scylfig like it was your own home. I thank you for that, ${PLAYER}.'","Find the memorial dedicated to Cuthard","'I bid you welcome! Cyneberg told us of your valour at Scylfig.'","Lit the memorial flame for Alferth","Find the memorial dedicated to Alferth"},
[5012]={"'Muy bien. Has hecho lo que te pedí. Te permitiré que me preguntes. ¿Qué es lo que quieres de mí?'\
\
Le explicas tu búsqueda de información sobre Luilloth.\
\
'¿Luilloth? ¿Qué edad crees que tengo? ¡No soy un elfo para vivir miles de años! ...Ahora que lo pienso, sin embargo, ese nombre me trae viejos recuerdos.'\
\
Henbran reflexiona, y su arrugado rostro se arruga aún más mientras piensa.\
\
'Sí, recuerdo que Luilloth tuvo algún trato con mi antepasado. Pero no puedo ayudarte. El conocimiento de lo que hablaron se ha perdido. ¡Robado! Mi malvada hermana, Cedrach la Cruel. Fue ella quien robó el grimorio de Amon, el libro de secretos que mi familia ha transmitido de generación en generación. Entre sus páginas recuerdo un relato sobre la dama Luilloth, pero ya no recuerdo para qué vino aquí. El tiempo me ha robado los recuerdos, mi hermana me ha robado el relato. ¡Y muchas cosas más! Ella me abandonó, ¿sabes? Completamente sola en este oscuro bosque. Una anciana sola. ¡Tan sola bajo las ramas negras, tan sola! ¡Tan sola!\
\
Hace una pausa dramática, como si esperara que le ofrecieras algunas palabras de consuelo, pero luego se apresura antes de que puedas hablar\
\
'Vive cerca del Brandivino, así que tal vez el grimorio no se haya perdido del todo. Nunca he estado en su nueva casa, que estoy segura de que es una cabaña. Soy demasiado anciana para hacer el viaje, ¡ella se aseguró de estar lo suficientemente lejos para garantizarlo! Podrías ir a buscar el libro para obtener respuestas. Si lo recuperas, ¡tráemelo! ¡Te recompensaré generosamente! Pero ten cuidado con mi hermana, ${CLASS}. Ha tenido décadas para estudiar el grimorio. Quién sabe qué poderes oscuros maneja ahora.'","Deberías llevar la milenrama, la corteza de sauce y las setas a Cedrach.\
\
Cedrach está en el Bosque Viejo.","Milenrama conseguida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Has encontrado todo? ¡Gracias! La corteza de sauce y la milenrama harán que mi hija se sienta mejor, y las setas serán parte de la cena de hoy.'","Consigue corteza de sauce (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cedrach Amon te ha pedido que consigas corteza de sauce, milenrama y setas de sombrero resbaladizo mientras busca el arcón en su cabaña.\
\
Deberías buscar estos objetos en el Bosque Viejo.","Vuelve con Cedrach","Problemas de familia","Corteza de sauce conseguida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ahora que le has dado los peces a Henbran, quiere hablar contigo sobre Luilloth. Los recuerdos, sin embargo, desaparecen con el tiempo. Y ha pasado mucho tiempo para Henbran.","Encuentra a Cedrach la Cruel","Consigue setas de sombrero resbaladizo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Saludos. Sí, soy Cedrach Amon. Veo que has hablado con mi hermana. ¡Henbran sigue siendo tan dramática como siempre! Bueno, no sé de qué grimorio habla. ¡No se me ocurriría robárselo! Sé lo import... Oh.'\
\
Para de hablar y frunce el ceño.\
\
'Oh cielos. Cuando decidí tener mi propia casa con mi esposo, me lleve´algunas cosas. Me llevé un cofre grande lleno de mantas que yo misma tejí, igual que el vestido de boda que estaba haciendo. ¡Hace mucho tiempo de eso! Mi esposo murió hace muchos años y mi propia hija se casó y perdió a su esposo. ¡A lo mejor el grimorio estaba en el cofre que traje cuando vine aquí! Si es así, me siento horrible. Nunca pretendí llevarme el grimorio de Henny. Siempre ha sido muy familiar y le gustaba saber de nuestra historia y nuestros ancestros. ¡Entiendo por qué cree que soy cruel! ¡Ay!\
\
'Escucha. puedo darte mis bendiciones, si quieres. Mi hija ha estado enferma varios días. e iba a salir para conseguir hierbas para tratarla. Si consigues lo que necesito, buscaré el cofre. \
\
'Necesito corteza de sauce, milenrama y setas de sombrero resbaladizo. Voy adentro a buscar el cofre.","Henbran Amon te ha sugerido que recuperes el grimorio de la familia Amon de su hermana, Cedrach la Cruel.\
\
Cedrach vive en el Bosque Viejo, en Cardolan.","Consigue milenrama (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[5013]={"'Thank you for retrieving this. It is priceless to the Yâshalam family. If anyone asks, nothing was found in the ruins, and we never asked for this. I'm sure you understand.\
\
'A curse? No, I think not. To commune with the dead is a privilege, not a curse, and one my family has not had in far too long.'","'You seem uniquely equipped for a task that requires some... delicacy. The Yâshalam family lost something years ago that was taken to the Mâkhda Khorbo. We have reason to believe this family heirloom, a necklace, is still there in the ruins. Unfortunately for us, the dead are more at home than the living in the Mâkhda Khorbo.\
\
'If you could retrieve this item for us, there would be a handsome reward for you. Not a word to anyone, though. Any rumours that leak out about the Yâshalams or this necklace would... displease the Lady Yâshalam.'","Family Secrets","Search the ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo for a heavy, ornate necklace that the Yâshalam family lost. The ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo can be found in the hills east of Khûtra.  Then bring it back to the Yâshalam Family Emissary, Miritah.","Find the Yâshalam family necklace","Return the family necklace to Miritah in Khûtra","The Yâshalam family's emissary, Miritah, has asked you to retrieve a family heirloom, a necklace, from the ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo.","'We are not paying by the day. With all due haste, I recall I said. We need that necklace back.'"},
[5014]={"'Ah, qué tiempos tan atribulados que vivimos. Los bandidos han estado saqueando las casas de gente en Archet, Entibo y Combe. ¡Deplorable! Algunos de esos pobres han llegado hasta Bree y me han contado su triste historia.\
\
No hay nada que me agradara más que ayudarles, pero no estoy hecho para las aventuras. ¿Por qué no intentas localizar a esos bandidos y traerme los objetos familiares robados? Podré entonces devolverlos a sus dueños legítimos. ¡Piensa en la expresión en sus rostros!\
\
Me han dicho que hay bandidos acampados en las Ruinas del Árbol Amarillo, al sur de Entibo; pero puede que otros en el bosque de Chet también posean objetos robados.'","Los bandidos pueden encontrarse en un gran campamento en las Ruinas del Árbol Amarillo, al sur de Entibo; pero puede que otros en el bosque de Chet también lleven objetos robados.\
\
Ya sea por benevolencia o por interés personal, Zancafirme te ha pedido que recolectes los objetos familiares robados de los bandidos y se los entregues en la Puerta de Combe de Bree.","Recoge bienes familiares robados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, ¡los encontraste! Fue un acto amable. Ahora, esperemos que pueda encontrar a las pobres personas a quienes les robaron estos objetos tan preciados.'","'¿Qué haces perdiendo el tiempo mientras la gente sufre? Ve a buscar las pertenencias de esas pobres personas para que pueda devolvérselas. Yo lo haría, pero no soy el tipo para aventuras.'","Tesoros familiares","Lleva los objetos familiares a Bruner Zancafirme","Bienes familiares robados recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bruner Zancafirme, un caballero de mala reputación procedente de Bree, ha decidido hacer una buena obra por los refugiados de los ataques del Montebruno."},
[5016]={"Patas de sapo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Well done, ${PLAYER}. You have saved me a tremendous amount of time and effort doing work that I detest.\
\
'Take this and go do your other tasks. These chores will not complete themselves.'","'Since you seem to be doing Alun's labour, then you can help me, as well. I am not certain what I did to upset the Elders, but they always give me the worst tasks.\
\
'They want me to gather food -- which is what I am accustomed to -- but toad-legs? Toads are disgusting creatures and make even worse food. Nevertheless, it is what they demand.\
\
'If you are to be of help, go hunt toads and take their legs. Bring them back to me, and perhaps I will not think of you as the bog-scum you are.'","'Perhaps you could keep gathering toad-legs for me? There are toads all around here. Hunt them and bring back their legs.'","Collect toad-legs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fancy Feasts","Talk to Séarl in the north-east Dunbog","Séarl has been tasked with gathering food for the Avanc-lûth. He personally does not have a taste for toad-legs, but that is what has been demanded by the Elders.","Toads are all around the camp-fire where Séarl is encamped in the Dunbog.\
\
Séarl has asked you to fetch toad-legs for him."},
[5022]={"Search Wellinghall for signs of upheaval","<rgb=#FF00FF>Look around</rgb> from the centre of Derndingle","Search the Easeful Mead for signs of upheaval","DNT -- Will not be seen","'Hoom... these are not good tidings, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I am thankful that Derndingle is free of threats... for we can begin our task of reclaiming the forest from this very spot. However, the wood-trolls concern me greatly, and to hear chittering at such a distance leads me to think the insects have grown beyond our control.\
\
'I must think on what we are to do next, little one...'","'Ta-rum! I have returned not a moment too soon, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Can you hear it, little one? Hoom... these woods are angry and have been thrust into chaos in our wake. I worry for what has become of my fellow Ents' homes and what could be lurking beyond our sight.\
\
'If you would search Treebeard's home, the mead to the north, and even look about the trees here in Derndingle, we can move to settle the forest once more.'","Since the Ents marched to war, the forest has been left upturned and angered. Quickbeam seeks knowledge of what has happened to Fangorn Forest before moving to act.","Search Derndingle for signs of upheaval","Talk to Quickbeam","Quickbeam can be found in Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have searched all of the locations to which Quickbeam directed you, and should now return to him with what you have learned.","The mead is fraught with brambles and you can faintly hear nearby chittering","Wellinghall can be found far to the north-west of Derndingle, the Easeful Mead to the north, and Derndingle in south-eastern Fangorn Forest.\
\
Quickbeam has asked you to scout Wellinghall, the Easeful Mead, and Derndingle for signs that the forest has grown wild and angry.","Fangorn Upturned","Wellinghall appears calm, but the growls of wood-trolls can be heard to the north-east","You see nothing strange around Derndingle"},
[5025]={"'Excellent. With the crebain kept at bay and the wolves leaderless, I think we have dealt with the feral threats of Emyn Lûm for the time being. \
\
'Long enough to do what we must, for we shall not tarry long beneath these dark boughs.'","Habla con Fuirgam en Ost Galadh","One of Fuirgam's trackers has been ambushed and slain by wolves in the forests of Emyn Lûm.","Defeated Sharpfang","Defeat Sharpfang","Sharpfang may be found at Hrigg Vidukuni, west of the Wild Ruins, south-west of Ost Galadh.\
\
Fuirgam has asked you to travel to Hrigg Vidukuni and search the area for the Emyn Lûm pack-leader, Sharpfang, and defeat him.","Fangs Bared","Fuirgam at Ost Galadh is at Ost Galadh, north of the Wild Ruins, north-east of Hrigg Vidukuni.\
\
You should return to Fuirgam with news of your success.","'Sorry news, I am afraid. One of my kin was slain in the forests just west of here, by wolves no less. Though we have encountered many Wargs trained as curs of the Enemy since we entered Mirkwood, we had thought the common wolves would stay at bay from our forces. It seems we were wrong, and there are those among them that would stalk our scouts should they travel alone.\
\
'Those of us who have learned the guttural speech of their kind have made out the name 'Sharpfang' among their wild howls -- it seems this leader claimed the kill, and I would see the beast put down as a lesson to the others that they dare not obstruct the Malledhrim.\
\
'They have been seen to gather some evenings by a stone circle to the west of the Wild Ruins called Hrigg Vidukuni by the Woodmen who dwell in Mirkwood. You may be able to find their leader there and deal with him.'","'I fear that Ivorel will have naught but unkind words for me when we return to Lothlórien.\
\
'I have pushed her and her scouts to the point of recklessness -- and spent several of their lives in so doing -- but we have no time for delicacy, and we need their eyes on every road and ravine.\
\
'If you should encounter her in the Scuttledells, please aid her in any way you may. I would very much like to see her return home unharmed.'"},
[5026]={"'This does not bode well for these Haradrim, and surely they must know it. If any more of their kin come to their aid here, I fear we shall be forced to slay them to protect ourselves and our brethren.\
\
'Were circumstances different... but no, we can ill afford to take chances with men we have long known to be loyal to the Enemy.\
\
'For the moment, we must keep our heads and sights clear.'","You approach Daugha-tûm. He remains silent, but his gaze is fixed upon you.\
\
You ask him several carefully-worded questions about his company's intent and the whereabouts of his kin in North Ithilien.\
\
You offer him a moment to respond.","Daugha-tûm does not respond to your questions.\
\
His face is twisted in a mix of anger and disappointment, and it would seem that the decision to surrender was not his to make. However, he makes no attempt to free himself from his bonds and appears to have come to terms with his captain's choice.\
\
Yet, before you can turn back to Maendal, you hear the cracking of a nearby twig and the shifting of stone within the old baths...","Question Daugha-tûm","Daugha-tûm can be found in Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien.\
\
Maendal has asked you to question the Haradrim prisoners, beginning with the warrior Daugha-tûm.","Talk to Maendal","Fangs Bared","Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren.\
\
You and the Rangers were forced to slay a rebelling Haradrim prisoner. You should talk to Maendal about what is to be done.","Daugha-tûm, a proud warrior of Harad, is the first to be questioned by you and the Rangers of Ithilien in hope of discovering why the Haradrim chose to surrender."},
[5029]={"Fangs from the East","Bring the wild cat fangs to Twiga at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","'Bring me the fangs of the wild cats, ${PLAYER}.'","Twiga is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, north-west of Lashkarg.\
\
You should bring the fangs you collected to Twiga as a token of your valour.","'These fangs will adorn our encampment, but I need more, ${PLAYER}. Have you not the courage to face these savage cats?'","'I must confess, the knowledge that these cats are trained to attack us is quite unnerving. The Khundolar did not come unprepared, that is for certain.\
\
'For this reason, we must seek to remove -- or at the very least lessen -- the threat the wild cats pose to us. Will you go forth and hunt the beasts? Bring me their fangs that I may know the number you have slain.'","Unnerved by the knowledge that the wild cats were trained to attack the Rohirrim, Twiga seeks to remove or lessen that threat.","Collected wild cat fangs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect wild cat fangs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have done well, ${PLAYER}, but I fear not well enough. However, I have a plan which may prove a greater boon to us.'","Wild cats can be found throughout the Brown Lands and at the Khundolar encampment of Lashkarg, south-east of Etheburg.\
\
Twiga has asked you to hunt the wild cats of the Brown Lands and bring him their fangs as a testament of your valour."},
[5032]={"Collect sabre-tooth fangs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect mist-walker pelts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'If you will not be talked out of avoiding the beasts, you may as well do away with any you come across. Bring back their hides and fangs. The tailor, Klátha, will use the furs to clothe our warriors and families, while the deadly fangs make for good weapons.'","Nósni is in Hagbuth in north-east Clovengap.\
\
Bring the furs and fangs to Nósni.","Beneath the crumbling arches of ancient vineyards prowls a deadly beast. Has the crystal corruption altered this already formidable foe?","Collected sabre-tooth fangs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Nósni","Clovengap mist-stalkers and sabre-tooth cats can be found in the vineyards.\
\
Nósni has asked you to bring back furs from Clovengap mist-stalkers and fangs from the deadly sabre-tooth cats of Clovengap.","'Ah, you return! And with such fine furs and fangs as well.'","Collected mist-walker pelts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fangs of the Mist-walkers"},
[5033]={"'There is one last thing you must do for me, then I will consider Mabon's debt paid, and he will be free. If you fail me now, I will sell the boy off to the mines.\
\
'To the south of Starkmoor is Wulf's Cleft. The armies of Dunland have been gathering and training there. I often sell them weapons, armour, and slaves for training practice. Lately, the sales have been slowing. You are going to fix that for me.\
\
'There is a cliff to the south that overlooks Wulf's Cleft. Once there, I want you to do as much injury as possible. The more weapons and armour you destroy, the more I can sell the warriors tomorrow. Speak with me when you are ready to go, and I will show you the path.'","Bedwur is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor.\
\
Bedwur will be pleased to hear you have secured a large profit for him from the forces at Wulf's Cleft.","Eva is in Avardin, in the central Starkmoor.\
\
Eva may have knowledge of where the boy has gone.","The great Dunlending camp of Wulf's Cleft lies to the south of Avardin and the Starkmoor.","The Auctioneer's treachery of Isengard finally caught up with him. There is no sign of the merchant's son","Talk to Eva in Avardin","Fangs of the Wulf","'Make sure you do as much damage as possible. I have a fresh set of conscripts and weapons ready to sell.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: This is a solo instance and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","Talk to Bedwur in Avardin","Bedwur is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor.\
\
Bedwur has asked you to travel to an overlook of Wulf's Cleft and destroy whoever comes to find you.","'You are looking for Mabon? I do not know where he went, but I have my suspicions.'","Talk to Bedwur to raid the outpost outside the Wulf's Cleft encampment"},
[5036]={"You failed to report back in to Raingon!","Raingon is at Talan Gwilith.\
\
You should speak with Raingon to prepare the defences for battle.","Fanuidhol attackers defeated (${VALUE}/30)","Fanuidhol Skirmish","The Orcs in Fanuidhol have been launching frequent small-scale attacks against the borders of Lórien to test and weaken the resolve of the defenders before they launch a major assault.","Raingon is at Talan Gwilith.\
\
With the assault turned aside, you should speak with Raingon.","Habla con Raingon en Talan Gwilith","'The Orcs come even now! Prepare our defences and reinforce our guards where you may! The Orcs will attack both here and at Talan Fanuidhol!'","The Elves have suffered too many casualties! (${VALUE}/12)","'The marchwardens tell me that you have acquitted yourself well during the recent skirmish. Allow me to offer you a token of our appreciation.''","Raingon has asked you to defeat the attackers out of Fanuidhol at both Talan Gwilith and Talan Fanuidhol, while protecting the Elven soldiers.","<rgb=#FF0000>Elvish Soldiers defeated (${VALUE}/12)</rgb>","'You have come none too soon, ${PLAYER}. The Orcs have been launching small assaults against us of late, and our scouts have seen another raiding party heading this way.\
\
'I need you at the base of these telain to help our soldiers on the ground drive off the Orcs with minimal casualties. We cannot afford to lose any more of our people, or we will be left shorthanded when their true assaults begin.'"},
[5037]={"The Master of Horses cares for a swift horse in the Cave of the Avorrim.\
\
Dorthaneth wants to fulfill the wishes of Lady Galadriel, and has asked you to borrow a fast horse from the Master of Horses and carry out an important errand in the Dead Marshes.","Far From Home","Talk to the Master of Horses in the Cave of the Avorrim","'If it be Dorthaneth's wish for you to depart in such haste, I will not stand in your way. The steeds of the Avorrim may give even the fabled Mearas a close race, if you want to know my opinion!\
\
'Ride swiftly, and at once, if it is the wish of Dorthaneth!'","A long journey of many miles finally concludes: you have come to the Dead Marshes","'I am glad you have come to the Cave of the Avorrim, ${PLAYER}, for with the dawn came messages from afar, and one of these concerns you directly. The Lady of Lórien speaks in cryptic words, but I can discern enough to know that you will be able to interpret her wishes.\
\
'Lady Galadriel speaks of a Gondorian man on an errand he believes important. It has drawn him into the Dead Marshes by the Battle Plain of old, and his feet are dogged by servants of the Enemy. The Lady of Lórien does not need to express her desire in words for me to know what drives this message: she does not want this Gondorian man to draw the attention of the Orcs to this place.\
\
'The Avorrim keep several fast horses for their personal use, but none so swift as that cared for by our Master of Horses. Speak to him and ride to the Dead Marshes with all the speed you can muster, and hasten this Gondorian back to his home-lands before he causes great harm by his presence there.'","Talk to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes","Borrow the swift horse from the Master of Horses and ride to the Dead Marshes","Dorthaneth has received word from the Lady of Lórien concerning an enterprising Gondorian in the Dead Marshes, and wants you to ensure he causes no trouble.","The Master of Horses is in the Cave of the Avorrim.\
\
Dorthaneth has asked you to speak to the Master of Horses, who cares for the swiftest Avorrim horses.","'Hail, stranger! It is good to see a friendly face in this inhospitable land! I caution you to watch your step, for I would not want to lose you so quickly beneath the mire... we have only just met!\
\
'I am Artamir son of Ilcamir, and I call the White City my home. From where do you come, my friend? No matter your answer you are far from home in this place, I warrant!'","Artamir, son of Ilcamir, has come to the Dead Marshes on an errand, but Galadriel of Lórien fears his presence there may draw unwanted attention to those lands.","'The Avorrim keep several fast horses for their personal use, but none so swift as that cared for by our Master of Horses. Speak to him and ride to the Dead Marshes with all the speed you can muster, and hasten this Gondorian back to his home-lands before he causes great harm by his presence there.'"},
[5038]={"Far From Shore","Melawen can be found in Malbarth in western Lebennin.\
\
Barchir has asked you to speak with the people of Malbarth before you depart for the east.","Talk to Melawen","'I am not certain what to make of your presence here, traveller.\
\
'Am I to be concerned that the war marches closer to our doors this day? Or... am I simply fortunate to have one as well-equipped as yourself visit our village?'\
\
You tell Barchir of Erianir's suggestion to travel north and then east to meet the other warriors near the Enemy's holdings outside Pelargir.\
\
'Ah, so that is it then. I am afraid I cannot offer you much in the way of aid in your journey beyond a cooked meal and firm bed, but my friends in Malbarth may have yet more to ask of you.'","'I refuse to believe our end comes soon.\
\
'Have even the most devout people of these lands dismissed the tales of old? I will not abandon hope while the Sisters still watch over Lebennin.'","Talk to Arvaeth","DNT -- will not be seen","Arvaeth can be found to the north-west of Malbarth in western Lebennin.\
\
Barchir has asked you to speak with the people of Malbarth before you depart for the east.","'I have heard word from Ost Anglebed that Lornost fell to the Corsairs...\
\
'Their stone walls did nothing to repel the Corsairs and Haradrim, much less those horrible half-trolls... what hope do we have?\
\
'I am sorry, traveller, I do not wish to speak more of this.'","'I bid you welcome to Malbarth, traveller.\
\
'If you have made it this far north, the Corsairs must be wary of you. For my part, I miss the bright, peaceful days that were once common in Lebennin... with the darkening of the sky, I do not see how any can be happy.\
\
'Strange things have been afoot near our homes, and I fear we will soon be forced into this war. I would ask you remain here a moment if you would seek to aid me.'","Lendithil can be found in Malbarth in western Lebennin.\
\
Barchir has asked you to speak with the people of Malbarth before you depart for the east.","Sheltered from the conflict growing on the coastline, the people of Malbarth look to their ancient beliefs for answers in these dark times.","Talk to Lendithil"},
[5039]={"'Our ruse may yet succeed, ${PLAYER}, but the Wainriders do not sound like any ally of ours -- even after we offered them the location of their hated foe.\
\
'It seems time cannot change some men... they are ever the stubborn folk they once were.\
\
'Now, my friend, we must move against the Bloodletter while the Wainriders prepare else all shall be lost!'","The Wainrider chieftain fades into shadow, but immediately reappears atop Dol Acharn!","Talk to Chieftain Zhan Ashû at Dol Acharn","'Through all the years I wandered the Wastes, I felt as if a great fog surrounded me -- blinding my sight and clouding my mind. Whether it was borne of confusion, fear, or the pains of this curse... I cannot say. I had centuries to overcome this illusion, and never did I succeed until I was convinced of my folly by you and Artamir.\
\
'${PLAYER}, do you understand? As I once did, the Wainriders must now suffer the same sickness of the mind. They are men outside their time in this age, and the truths of their past are all they shall see fit to believe.\
\
'As the men of Gondor were in the time of the Wainriders, Burudagath the Bloodletter is a man of Númenor. Although the Númenóreans were once one people, their fates were divided through the influence of the Dark Lord. The Faithful defied Sauron and believed not his lies, but many others fell to evil and became known as Black Númenóreans -- and Burudagath is but one of them in service of the Dark Lord. Even with how far he has fallen, he cannot deny his heritage... and the blood he shares with my people of old.\
\
'I understand you may have heard these tales, my friend, but this shared lineage might be turned to our advantage. To a man of Gondor, the history of Númenor is great and terrible... yet to a foe of our peoples, such tales and truths are but a trifle. A hatred so blind does not measure the goodness or evil in Men.\
\
'The Wainriders at Dol Acharn need only understand that a man of Númenor flies the banner of a king of Gondor -- and of their hated foe, Ondoher.\
\
'My friend, go to Dol Acharn and call forth their chieftain... he must be convinced of Burudagath's heritage and the banner he bears. If you succeed, his deeds, good or ill, shall be but a whisper in their ears as their hatred calls them to battle!'","'You have my attention, ${RACE}. You stand before Zhan Ashû of the Wainriders! Speak quickly or I shall remove you from my sight!'\
\
You warn Zhan Ashû that Burudagath of Númenor has come to the Wastes and stands upon the western hill of the battle plain in defiance of the Wainriders under the banner of a king of Gondor.\
\
'Gondorian dogs! No matter how many we slay, they rise against us anew! They think themselves our betters, but we do not shrink from battle so easily!'\
\
Zhan Ashû begins to shout to nearby Wainriders.\
\
'Ready the wains and chariots, men! Gondor shall breathe its last this day, and the men of Númenor shall finally be vanquished!\
\
For merely a moment, a wave of confusion washes over Zhan Ashû's face.\
\
'Yet, why would one such as you offer us knowledge of our greatest foe? I do not understand...'\
\
Zhan Ashû seems to steady his resolve.\
\
'...but I shall not dismiss it!\
\
'Go, ${RACE}! Warn this Burudagath if you must, but do not attempt to stand between us and our prey!'","Faramir can be found due west of Dol Acharn in Dagorlad.\
\
You have told the Wainrider chieftain of the Bloodletter's heritage and of the banner he bears, but his people still remained hostile despite their apparent gratitude. You should return to Faramir.","Confront and defeat the Wainrider chieftain at Dol Acharn","Faramir's Ruse","Talk to Faramir near Dol Acharn","Chieftain Zhan Ashû can be found atop Dol Acharn in eastern Dagorlad.\
\
You have bested the chieftain in combat and he now wishes to speak to you. You should attempt to convince him of the Bloodletter's danger to his people.","Faramir, son of Ondoher has devised a ruse to confound the Wainriders into both ending the treachery of the Bloodletter at Ondoher's Folly and ignoring the advance of the Host of the West.","A chill washes over you as the Wainrider chieftain appears!","The Wainrider chieftain can be found somewhere within Dol Acharn. Disturbing an object of his people might rouse him to step forth from the shadows.\
\
Faramir has asked you to draw forth and defeat the Wainrider chieftain in the hope you might gain an audience with him."},
[5041]={"Raghda-gûn has realized she may not be best suited to care for little Berkha.","Talk to Berkha","Farewell to Berkha","The little duck waddles away from Raghda-gûn, but he doesn't make it more than a few feet before he looks back at the one who took him in.\
\
'Quack!'\
\
The single word could not hope to capture the depth of his gratitude or his love, but it will have to do.","Raghda-gûn has realized she may not be best suited to care for little Berkha, and has arranged for you to take him with you.\
\
Speak to Berkha at Raghda-gûn's nest, Aklâradum, atop a cliff south of Halrax.","'${PLAYER}, I begin to suspect that I may not be best suited to care for young Berkha here. The life of a Roc and the life of a duck are so very different. He seems to have taken a shine to you, however. Would you be interested in taking him on your travels? The wind has brought me stories of a far away place known as the Shire. I hear it is ever peaceful. Perhaps you could take him there some day?'\
\
You look at Berkha, who quacks at you. How could anyone say no to that?\
\
'Well, he at least seems amenable to the idea,' Raghda-gûn says.\
\
'Berkha, it has been a treat to have you around. You do not seem to listen to my wishes and your ability to hunt for prey is lacking, but you were at least amusing. May your belly always be full and your feathers clean.'"},
[5042]={"'Adiós, ${PLAYER}. Has sido una bendición para nosotros y un verdadero placer conocerte.\
\
'Buen viaje y cuídate.'\
\
Coloca un pequeño paquete con pan en tus manos.","Eluna te ha pedido que te despidas de sus estudiantes antes de marcharte.\
\
Habla con Murig, Deryn y Marget.","Habla con Eluna","Habla con Murig","Eluna te ha pedido que hables con la gente de Lhan Garan.","Murig sonríe cálidamente mientras te acercas.\
\
'No tenías obligación para con nosotros y aun así te has puesto en peligro una vez tras otra. Gracias.\
\
'Los otros y yo mantendremos Lhan Garan a salvo. Aquí estará siempre que quieras venir a visitarnos.","Adiós a Lhan Garan","'Hola.\
\
'Me entristece verte marchar, pero más que eso, agradezco ante todo haberte conocido. Estos últimos meses han sido una dura prueba para todos nosotros. Echar raíces en una tierra extraña, lejos de todo lo que nos resulta familiar, no es fácil. Hace que cada gesto de amabilidad cobre un mayor significado.\
\
'Ardhun? Bueno, ahora está atrapada con nosotros. De forma egoísta, me alegra que así sea. Prefiero que esté aquí conmigo, aunque se pase todo el invierno de morros.\
\
'Cuídate mucho ahí fuera.'","Eluna está esperándote.\
\
Habla con Eluna.","Habla con Deryn","'Antes de irte, di adiós a los niños, por favor.'","Marget tiene su atención en Ardhun. Solo cuando te acercas parece recordar el mundo que le rodea.\
\
'Dime, viajero, viste cómo luchó, ¿verdad? ¿Cómo crees que me iría a mí contra ella?'\
\
Marget te sonríe, y hay un atisbo de peligro y malicia en sus ojos.\
\
'Tan bien como me iría contra ti, supongo.\
\
'He oído que pronto nos dejarás. Espero que el resto de tus aventuras sean al menos la mitad de emocionantes que la que compartimos.\
\
'Ven a visitarnos de nuevo. Y trae pan. De alguna manera, el de Deryn sabe a medicina.'"},
[5043]={"'And so, the ship has left our gates to make way towards the western coast. It had to be done, ${PLAYER}, for I cannot guarantee their safety here, nor my own.\
\
'Hopefully it will reach Dol Amroth without incident. I would only expect to set my mind at rest once I've heard word from them, but until that day comes, I must carry out my duties.'","Join Faltharan as he says his good-byes","Faltharan can be found at the steps to Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Faltharan.","Farewell to Pelargir","Faltharan has asked you to accompany him as his family departs for more safe lands.","Talk to Faltharan","DNT - Not Used","'Come, let us make our way to the docks. I don't intend to stay for longer than is necessary, but I wish to make sure everything is in order for their departure.'","Faltharan can be found at the steps to Tol Ciryarani.\
\
Speak with Faltharan to head to the shipyard.","'All the plans are set, and we are finally ready to set our matters into motion.\
\
'Pelargir is a city that deserves to be restored to its former glory. With that, we will need to preserve its people, as well as its bloodline. We cannot protect everyone from the storm that has arrived, but we can try to steer them away from it.\
\
'I understand that my family wishes to speak before their departure. Will you accompany, ${PLAYER}?'"},
[5044]={"Speak with Gifemund","'I believe he is sincere in providing adequate protection and in his desire to bring everyone in Woodhurst together. However, the soothsayer mentioned a growing darkness, and someone or something powerful is working against us, driving our people apart.\
\
'I agree with his sentiment that our Rohirrim and Dunlending brothers should be able to co-exist. Most in this city have the blood of both. I believe they are who Gifemund seeks to align to his cause more than anyone else.'","'Most of my wounds have healed, but I am still fairly weak. This city cannot wait for me. Gifemund is a strong ally, but he does not seem able to keep control of the city. What or who is drawing such darkness and hate upon us?\
\
'I have heard rumours from Calin that farmers have gone missing. I worry for them, and particularly for the owner of this home; my dear friend who graciously let us stay here. Please speak to Calin, and see if you can help.'","Return to Herubrand in his hideout within the farmhouse cellar and tell him of Gifemund's promise to keep the fields watched.","Speak with Gifemund about the security concerns in the city. He has taken over the protection for Woodhurst, and it is clear that things have not gotten better.","Farm-fields of Woodhurst","Herubrand should be told of the farmers being murdered so close to where he is hiding.","Found bodies in the farm-field (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The fields are disturbed by someone who has no regard for the crops. This was clearly not the farmer's doing. It does not bode well for the missing farmers.","Find bodies in the farm-field (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Calin is on the first floor of the farmhouse, and is looking into arranging a search party for the missing farmers.","Speak with Herubrand","Investigate the farm-fields","Herubrand has been staying in the cellar of the farmers' house, but Calin and Herubrand have not seen them in over a day and begin to worry about them.","'I cannot believe they are gone....\
\
'I am devastated by what is happening to this once fair city. Stuck in this cellar, I am unable to take in the beauty of Woodhurst. But, it would be hard to enjoy such beauty when surrounded by malice and the blood of my family and friends. The violence is a stark contrast to the beauty this city holds.\
\
'Please speak with Gifemund about his security efforts here in Woodhurst. We must do something about this.'","Speak with Calin","Return to Herubrand","'I am sad to hear that Woodhurst has lost more good men. We were not watching those fields as closely as we should have, and it seems we are too late now. The fields will be watched from now on.\
\
'I believe Woodhurst can be a place where Rohirrim and Dunlending can co-exist, as we are simply the people of the Stonedeans. Why must there be such hatred between us, when we have been brothers here for a long time?'","You found a place where it seems people broke into the city and disturbed the field...","The farmers have gone missing, and are suspected to be out in the fields somewhere.","'The rumours are true: the farmers have all gone missing, including the man who owns this house. They have not been seen for over a day! That is very unusual for them. We need to look for them right away. I worry something terrible has happened.\
\
'Please head out to the fields and begin looking for them. I will try to find others who can aid in the search.'"},
[5045]={"Expulsado de su tierra y herido por trasgos descontrolados, Cendrew Hove busca la forma de compensar a sus anfitriones.","Vuelve con Cendrew","¡La caja de herramientas está vacía! Los trasgos ha debido robar las herramientas","Cendrew Hove te ha pedido que recuperes sus herramientas de carpintero de su granja.\
\
La granja de la familia Hove está en Cardolan.","'Saludos. Me llamo Cendrew Hove. He oído que Edrud te hablaba de nuestra granja. Si vas en esa dirección, me gustaría pedirte un favor. Me hice daño en la espalda durante la incursión a nuestra granja, por lo que no puedo ayudar tanto como solía hacerlo. Si voy a estar aquí parado, todavía puedo ser útil, pero no sin mis herramientas de carpintero.\
\
'Por favor, si vas a nuestra granja, ¿podrías buscar mis herramientas? Las dejé cerca de la casa.'","Busca las herramientas de carpintero","Herramientas robadas recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las herramientas del granjero Hove","Has encontrado la caja de herramientas del granjero, pero estaba vacía. Sospechas que los trasgos que han tomado la granja se han llevado las herramientas. Debes acabar con trasgos en la granja Hove y recuperar las herramientas robadas.\
\
La granja Hove se encuentra en el centro de Cardolan, hacia el norte.","Deberías llevar las herramientas de carpintero a Cendrew Hove.\
\
Cendrew está en la granja Scurloc, en el noreste de Cardolan.","'¡Mis herramientas! Ya puedo ayudar por aquí. ¡Muchas gracias, de verdad! ¡Por todo lo que has hecho!'","Recupera las herramientas robadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[5046]={"'Asphodel mantiene su granja funcionando vendiendo sus productos en el Mercado de Granjeros. Hice un trato con Himloc Grouse para pagar el doble de lo que otros pagan por sus vegetales frescos.\
\
'¿Podrías ir a su granja, recoger los productos que piensa vender y entregarlos a Himloc? Asegúrate de devolverle el dinero cuando termines.'","'¿Así que tienes algunos productos para vender de la Viuda Froghorn, verdad? Bueno, los tomaré... y aquí está el pago.\
\
'Y antes de que empieces a pensar que me he vuelto blando de la cabeza, eso es el doble de lo que normalmente pago. Eldo Swatmidge y yo tenemos un acuerdo, porque me pidió que pagara el doble por cualquiera de los productos de la Viuda, luego él me da la diferencia. Es cierto lo que dicen: un hobbit enamorado no tiene sentido común de hobbit.\
\
'Lleva ese pago de vuelta a la Viuda Froghorn y no menciones el acuerdo que tengo con Swatmidge. Eso es parte de todo el arreglo.'","'Lleva los productos de Asphodel a Himloc Grouse en el pueblo... y no olvides mencionar mi buen trato a mis perros.'","Recolecta productos de Asphodel Froghorn","La granja de la Viuda Froghorn está al este de Entibo.\
\
Asphodel Froghorn está esperando el pago que recibiste de Himloc Grouse por la venta de sus vegetales.","'¿Estás aquí por la Viuda Froghorn?'","Himloc Grouse normalmente se encuentra en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo, al oeste de la granja de la Viuda Froghorn.\
\
Asphodel parece pensar bien de ti y te ha pedido que vendas algunos de sus productos a Himloc Grouse, el comerciante.","Mercado de Granjeros","'¿El viejo Himloc cumplió su parte del trato? Bien, bien. Bueno, lleva ese dinero a Asphodel ahora y asegúrate de mencionar mi buen sentido común de hobbit.'","'Esto parece un poco exagerado. ¿Tienes la seguridad de que Himloc te dio la cantidad correcta? No, no me lo digas. Tengo la sensación de que Eldo Swatmidge podría tener algo que ver con la generosidad de Himloc.'","Lleva la cesta de vegetales a Himloc Grouse","'¿Eldo no envió a un holgazán, verdad?\
\
'¿Y es amable con sus perros? ¡Qué tal eso!\
\
'Ya que ya has demostrado ser tan útil, ¿por qué no llevas esto a Entibo y lo vendes a Himloc Grouse? Probablemente estará en la plaza del pueblo. Quizás entonces podamos continuar nuestra conversación sobre las buenas cualidades de Eldo Swatmidge, de las cuales estoy segura me dirás que hay muchas.'","La granja de la Viuda Froghorn está en el camino al oeste y al sur de la granja de Eldo Swatmidge.\
\
Eldo Swatmidge te pidió que recolectaras los productos que Asphodel Froghorn piensa vender.","'¿No recibiste ningún pago de Himloc? Eso es muy inusual.'","Lleva el pago de Himloc a Asphodel Froghorn","Productos recolectados de Asphodel Froghorn","'¡Te dije que la habías impresionado! Parece que estamos progresando, sí que lo parece.\
\
'Por cierto, le dije al viejo Himloc que cuando compre productos de Asphodel, debería pagar el doble de lo que normalmente pagaría, y yo le daría la diferencia. Pensé que deberías saberlo: no te sorprendas cuando hables con él.'","Eldo Swatmidge es un granjero exitoso, pero está solo. Ha buscado tu ayuda para cortejar a su vecina, la Viuda Froghorn.","'Lleva ese pago de vuelta a la Viuda Froghorn... pero no le digas por qué pagué tanto.'","'Si vas a ofrecer tu trabajo voluntariamente, también podrías llevar mis productos a Himloc Grouse.'"},
[5047]={"'¡Si no les avisas, casi mejor que no abramos todavía! ¡Date prisa!'","'Nos has ayudado enormemente, y por ello te estoy muy agradecido. Tengo una última cosa que pedirte.\
\
'El mercado abrirá mañana. Esperaba que pudieras ir por el camino hacia Dwaling y avisar a los hobbits de allí que, gracias a una ayuda excepcional, este año empezaremos el mercado un poco antes.\
\
'Solo tienes que seguir el camino hacia el este desde Avenal, y muy pronto llegarás a Dwaling. Encuentra a Hob Cimacolina y díselo.'","Habla con Hob Cimacolina en Dwaling","Hob Cimacolina está en Dwaling, al noreste de Avenal.\
\
Albin Cotonorte te ha pedido que te aventures en Dwaling y les avises de que el mercado agrícola abrirá antes este año.","'Me alegra mucho oír que el mercado empieza mañana, pero me temo que no podremos ir. Hay demasiadas cosas en marcha aquí como para marcharnos.'","Los hobbits que viven en Dwaling estarán impacientes por saber que el mercado agrícola de Cotonorte está abierto.","El mercado agrícola está abierto"},
[5048]={"The recipe for hardy bulbs (both field and crop) has been given to you by Hildelith.\
\
You should farm hardy bulbs for the folk of Wildermore.","Deliver the hardy bulbs to Hildelith","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Farmer: Hardy Bulbs","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have crafted Hardy Bulbs and should now deliver them to Hildelith.","Farmed hardy bulbs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Farm hardy bulbs for the folk of Wildermore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I hear that you have some skill in tilling the lands. The people here are not accustomed to such cold winters. Do you have any knowledge of plants that might be more hardy that can be given to the farmers of Wildermore?\
\
'We must begin growing where we can, but it will be different now.'","'Ah! I have never seen this variety before. Will it truly thrive in this wintry climate? I hope so....'","A skilled farmer such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by cultivating hardy bulbs for them."},
[5049]={"Puedes encontrar a la Pregonera del Festival en el centro de Delagua durante el festival de la Feria Agrícola.\
\
¡Habla con ella para reclamar tus boletos del festival gratuitos!","Boletos de la Feria Agrícola","'¡Aquí están tus boletos, ${PLAYER}! ¡Diviértete y disfruta de la feria!'","¡La Feria Agrícola Anual ha llegado por la cosecha! Cada día puedes reclamar unos cuantos boletos gratis para probar algunos de los eventos ofrecidos en la Feria.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","'Cada día ofrecemos unos cuantos boletos para los que asistentes a la Feria para que prueben los juegos que tenemos disponibles. ¡Prueba los champiñones de Maggot en Bamfurlargo, o la Carrera de Huevos en la granja de Arenilla!\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Nota: Si quisieras adquirir boletos adicionales, ¡estarán disponible en la Tienda LOTRO a través de los hobbits responsables de los juegos!</rgb>","Reclama tus boletos de la Feria Agrícola"},
[5050]={"'¡Hola, ${PLAYER}! Estamos a punto de enviar al siguiente grupo de participantes a los campos del granjero Maggot. Pero ten cuidado... este año nuestras actividades han puesto a Garra, Colmillo y Lobo en un auténtico frenesí. Tendrás que recoger esos hongos rápidamente antes de que detecten tu olor.\
\
'Ah, y vigila lo que comes... algunos de los participantes han informado de efectos extraños tras consumir las variedades de hongos más raras de este año.'","'¡Guau! Les diste vueltas a los perros de Maggot. ¡Espero que hayas dejado hongos para los demás!'","Hongos devorados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Feria de los Granjeros: La Cacería de Hongos de Maggot","Espera a que comience la partida","Recoge más hongos","Habla con Osbert Barroso para recibir las fichas por haber ganado la cacería de hongos.","Quedan diez segundos en la cacería de hongos","¡Felicidades! ¡Has ganado la cacería de hongos!","La cacería de hongos de Maggot ha comenzado","Habla con Osbert Barroso","Saliste del campo de maíz de Maggot...","Evita a los perros de Maggot","No comiste suficientes hongos. Inténtalo de nuevo","Los hobbits jóvenes de la Comarca mantienen desde hace mucho tiempo la tradición de colarse en los campos del granjero Maggot para robar los hongos suculentos que crecen a la sombra de las hileras de maíz. Al granjero Maggot no le hacen ninguna gracia estos intrusos, y cada año, cuando llega la época de la cosecha, suelta a sus tres perros, Colmillo, Garra y Lobo, por los campos para ahuyentar a los hobbits indeseables. Este año, un pequeño grupo de hobbits audaces ha convertido estas incursiones en un 'evento' no oficial de la Feria de los Granjeros, formando grupos para intentar robar los hongos silvestres.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","'Deberías dirigirte al campo en breve. Trataremos de buscar algunos de esos sabrosos hongos que crecen por ahí... pero ten cuidado: en cuanto el granjero Maggot nos vea, seguro que nos soltará sus perros. ¡Mantente lejos de ellos!\
\
'Regresa aquí cuando hayas comido suficientes hongos.'","Recoge al menos cinco hongos.","Uno de los perros de Maggot te ha visto","Has conseguido devorar cinco de los hongos de Maggot... ¡Sigue comiendo tantos como puedas antes de que termine el juego!"},
[5051]={"¡Has cogido un huevo festivo!","Habla con Wymarc Cavada para recibir las fichas por haber ganado la carrera de los huevos.","Has salido del gallinero de Sandson","Espera a que comience la partida","Recoge huevos blancos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La carrera de los huevos de Sandson comenzará en breve. Tu objetivo es recoger al menos cinco huevos blancos, pero puedes ganar fichas adicionales recogiendo más huevos... ¡y especialmente si consigues los raros huevos de colores!\
\
Espera en el gallinero hasta que Wymarc Cavada declare el inicio del juego.","La carrera de los huevos de Sandson ha comenzado","Has conseguido reunir cinco huevos blancos. Recoge todos los que puedas antes de que termine el juego.\
\
Intenta coger cualquier huevo festivo que veas.","Recoge más huevos","Feria de los Granjeros: La carrera de los huevos de Sandson","¡Puaj! ¡Un huevo podrido!","¡Felicidades! ¡Has ganado la carrera de los huevos!","Wymarc Cavada supervisa la carrera anual de los huevos, en la que hobbits y visitantes, jóvenes y mayores por igual, corretean tras las gallinas del granjero Sandson con la esperanza de recoger los huevos puestos en medio del pánico. Parece que el pienso especial de Sandson contenía ingredientes poco habituales este año, ya que algunos de los huevos que ponen sus gallinas presentan colores realmente extraños. Aun así, puede que los coleccionistas de huevos les encuentren algún valor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento al que está asociada. </rgb>","¡Quedan diez segundos en la carrera de los huevos!","'¡Hola, ${PLAYER}! ¿Has venido a participar en la carrera de los huevos de Sandson? Estas son las reglas: permanece aquí, en el gallinero. Cuando comience el evento, las mejores gallinas de Sandson saldrán de sus jaulas y empezarán a poner huevos. Con tanta gente alrededor, se alteran un poco y corren por todas partes, así que la situación puede volverse bastante confusa.\
\
'Si consigues recoger cinco huevos blancos antes de que se acabe el tiempo, ganarás fichas extra de la feria. Además, al abrir los huevos también obtendrás fichas adicionales, ganes o pierdas.\
\
'Ah, también debo mencionar que algún bromista parece haber añadido ingredientes poco habituales al alimento de las gallinas, y de vez en cuando ponen huevos bastante, ejem, extraños. Parece que hay coleccionistas que los valoran, así que, aunque no cuenten para la carrera, quizá quieras recogerlos igualmente.'","¡Has recogido un huevo festivo!","Huevos blancos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","No has recogido suficientes huevos. Inténtalo de nuevo","Recoge cinco huevos blancos tan rápido como puedas.","Habla con Wymarc Cavada","'¡Tienes pies rápidos y manos firmes, ${PLAYER}! ¡Enhorabuena por ganar la carrera de los huevos de Sandson!\
\
'Vuelve a jugar cuando quieras... y no pierdas de vista los huevos festivos que veas por ahí. He oído que hay coleccionistas interesados en ese tipo de cosas.'"},
[5052]={"'Los Páramos del Norte son un lugar peligroso... no hace ni dos días, ¡vi un lobo justo en el límite de Avenal! No había oído nada igual desde el Invierno Cruel, aunque supongo que Hal podría contarte una de sus historias sobre extrañas criaturas.\
\
'Aun así, mi granja de avena ha estado teniendo problemas con las langostas, ¡y el frontero espera que yo las espante! Encontrar una vaca perdida o perseguir un zorro sí es tarea mía, pero no deshacerme de plagas. Supongo que tú entenderás más de este tema.\
\
'Mis tierras están al este y al noreste de aquí. Si exterminas a esas langostas y salvas la cosecha, me aseguraría de recompensarte. Además, echa un vistazo por si encuentras algo fuera de lugar en mis tierras... los animales han estado apareciendo muertos por todo Avenal recientemente.\
\
'¡Nunca he tenido que preocuparme tanto en todos mis años cultivando avena! Pero el negocio ha ido mejor últimamente y, \\qla mejor cosecha solo llega tras la lluvia\\q o eso decía mi viejo padre.'","'Has exterminado las langostas, y eso está muy bien, pero estoy preocupado por esos lobos que has visto merodeando por mis tierras. Insectos devorando la cosecha son algo fácil, ¡pero lobos en mis tierras ya es otra cosa!'","'¿Has exterminado a esas langostas, ${PLAYER}? Recuerda, no verás ni un penique hasta que el trabajo esté terminado. Mis tierras están justo al este y al noreste de aquí, por si lo has olvidado.'","Derrota a los enjambres de langostas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las langostas son la ruina del sustento de los cultivadores de avena de Avenal","La ruina del granjero","Derrota a las reinas langosta (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has encontrado algo fuera de lugar en las tierras de Nibs Redondo","Nibs redondo está en su granja, al este de Avenal.\
\
Debes volver con Nibs Redondo y hablarle del cadáver de alce y el lobo que te atacó.","Las tierras de Nibs Redondo están al este y noreste de su granja.\
\
Nibs Redondo ha aceptado tu oferta de ayuda y te ha indicado dónde se encuentran sus tierras.","Enjambres de langostas derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra algo fuera de lugar en las tierras de Nibs Redondo"},
[5063]={"There are muffled calls for help from nearby. Search for those around the farm needing your help","You found and rescued Torwulf","The farms in the Fallows were abandoned when Núrzum attacked Forlaw, and it was deemed unsafe to be outside the city walls. Thrymm's Farm is the meeting place for anyone in the outlying farms who are escaping to the safety of Forlaw.","Find the survivors around Thrymm's Farm (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","There are a few survivors calling for help around Thrymm's Farm. These calls seem to be coming from around the outer edges of the farm.","Find Oter in the centre of Thrymm's Farm","Farms of the Fallows","'The farmlands were recently abandoned when Núrzum and the Orcs attacked Forlaw. Not everyone from the farms has made it back, and they could be in trouble. Forlaw is losing contact with so much of Wildermore these days.\
\
'The nearest farm is Thrymm's, and is just south-east of Forlaw. That is where those working the fields are supposed to go if the outer farms run into trouble. Please, go and look for any survivors that are out there!'","The rescued farmers ran off toward the barn in the centre of the farm. Find and talk to Oter, who seems to be the senior among these farmers.","'Thank you for rescuing us. The other two made it here from other farms, but I've been working this farm my entire life. They say the other farms are completely destroyed! But the Warg-riders came here only to harass us, and probably would have killed us if you didn't come along when you did.\
\
'We have much work to do here if we are to recover this farm and get these fields tended to again.'","You found and rescued Siric","'¡Gracias!'","'Thanks for your help!'","Find Thrymm's Farm near Forlaw","Thrymm's Farm is south-east of Forlaw. The road outside the east gate has a fork, and the southern path runs straight through this farm.","You found and rescued Oter","'Thank you, kind ${RACE}.'"},
[5064]={"Los Crebain han estado robando cascos y sombreros a los buenos ciudadanos de Urmâkh. Un explorador local los ha rastreado hasta Ghât Okho. Debes recuperar los tocados de estos descarados ladrones alados.","Recupera los tocados en Ghât Okho y derrota a los crebain.","Crebain derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Robo a la moda","Cascos robados recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Eso es una buena cantidad de cascos que has recuperado. Me pregunto qué planeaban hacer los crebain con todos ellos. Tal vez solo disfrutan de la forma en que reflejan la luz.'","Recupera los cascos robados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los crebain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[5065]={"You have found a suitable spare wheel for Natholan's waggon. Return it to Natholan just outside of Echad Lendir.\
\
Echad Lendir can be found to the east along the road to Barad Faen.","Natholan is not confident his waggon will make the rest of the journey.","'I suspected as much on the way up from Melgobas. Hello, stranger!\
\
'The creaks from my waggon worried me. I was not confident I could make it to Iáphel, much less meet my travelling companions up on the ridge.\
\
'I have found the culprit. The spokes are about to give. Could you perhaps aid me?\
\
'I couldn't find a suitable spare wheel in Barad Faen, but I'm almost certain there exists one in Lond Cirion.\
\
'Would you be so kind as to fetch me a spare wheel?'","You have found a suitable spare waggon wheel","Fasten A Waggon","Talk to Natholan at Echad Lendir","Find a spare waggon wheel in Lond Cirion","'Ah, this should perform splendidly! Not only can I join my companions up on the ridge, but I should be able to make the remainder of the trip to Iáphel.\
\
'You have my gratitude, traveller.'","Natholan has asked you to find a spare wheel in Lond Cirion.\
\
Lond Cirion can be found to the west."},
[5066]={"'Took you long enough to find us out! We always outsmart the people 'round here, but most of them don't know it.\
\
'Mother won't let us in the Mead Hall because she knows we're up to no good!'","Grimwald only smiles smugly at you. You find that you don't like this little boy very much. His breathing is not even laboured!\
\
'One more race? Back to the front gate. I am sure you'll win this time, since you already know the way!'","'Those twins have you running all over town, do they? I can't believe you let them trick you. None of us townsfolk have fallen for that trick in many a year.'","'So slow! However do you travel across the lands when you cannot outrun a boy?'","Grimwald is outside the Mead Hall of Grimslade.\
\
You should speak with Grimwald.","Race Grimwald to the stable in the north-west of town","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the Mead Hall in Grimslade.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the Mead Hall.","Faster Than a Flash","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the front gate of Grimslade.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the front gate.","'You lose! I have already been here for ages.'","Race to the north-west stable!","Speak with Grimwald to begin the race","Race Grimwald to the front gate","'Too slow! Such a shame.'","Run to the front gate! Grimwald thinks he can beat you.","Speak with Grimwald at the Mead Hall","Grimwald has beaten you soundly....","'Are you ready to race? You may get a head start, if you like. Try and beat me to the front gate of town.\
\
'I am very fast! Ready? Go!'","Race to the Mead Hall!","Make it to the front gate before Grimwald","'I am Grimwald, son of Grimbold! My mother will not let me in the Mead Hall when she is acting as Thane, so I stay out here and run around.\
\
'Say, would you care to have a race? I'll even give you a head start.'","Grimwald is outside of Grimslade's Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Grimwald.","Twins! You've been tricked....","Grimwald, son of Grimbold, has challenged you to a race. Outrunning such a small fellow should not be difficult.","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the stable in the south-west of town.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the stable.","Race Grimwald to the Mead Hall","Race to the front gate!"},
