\
'I am very fast! Ready? Go!'","Grimwald, son of Grimbold, has challenged you to a race. Outrunning such a small fellow should not be difficult.","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the front gate of Grimslade.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the front gate.","'You lose! I have already been here for ages.'","Make it to the front gate before Grimwald","Speak with Grimwald to begin the race","'I am Grimwald, son of Grimbold! My mother will not let me in the Mead Hall when she is acting as Thane, so I stay out here and run around.\
\
'Say, would you care to have a race? I'll even give you a head start.'","Grimwald is outside of Grimslade's Mead Hall.\
\
You should speak with Grimwald.","Run to the front gate! Grimwald thinks he can beat you.","Faster Than a Flash"},
[5068]={"Grimwald, son of Grimbold, has challenged you to a race. Outrunning such a small fellow should not be difficult.","Grimwald has beaten you again....","The end of your race with Grimwald is at the stable in the south-west of town.\
\
You should race Grimwald to the stable.","'Oh, hello there, slow-poke. I told you I am very fast. Would you care to have another race?\
\
'I will give you an even longer head start this time.\
\
'Let us race to the stable at the far south-west side of town.'","Race Grimwald to the stable in the south-west of town","'Too slow! Such a shame.'","Faster Than a Flash II"},
